            //   => fVirglLock (TPasMPCriticalSection) serialises the entire DeviceRecv body,
            //      ensuring only one worker executes virgl/EGL calls at a time.
            //   Display/render thread: reads fFrameBufferItems ring buffer via TransferFrame.
            //     OnScanoutUpdate (called from inside the locked DeviceRecv)
            //     copies scanout pixels into fFrameBufferItems with memory barriers;
            //     the display thread reads the latest entry with matching barriers.
